                                 DropDead
                                 --------

  Drop dead is a little util that punishes the user who drop's carrier on
  your board too many times. It's easily installed like this:
 
  Add to line #80 ( Should be something like 'Lost Carrier') in your bbstext
  
    #0 pfiles:drop.rexx}
    ^
    |
    |
   This is an <CTRL+Q>

  Then you decide who many times a user may drop carrier on you at the line
  in drop.REXX that says 'max = 2' (this means that the third time the user
  drops carrier he will be punished) , so if you wan't your user to be 
  punished after 5 drop's, youll alter max to 4....

  Then you have to decide what the punishment should be, you got three 
  alternatives to choose between and, you may combine them in every way you
  want. To take bytecreds, set credsleft to the amount of creds you wan't
  the user to maintain, i.e if you set credsleft = 5, 5 bytes is what the
  user will keep. Putting credsleft = 'none'  won't take any bytecreds.

  And the same way it is with filesleft, except that this one will take
  filecreds.

  Status is actually the status the user will get after his droped enough.
  putting this higher than 31 will turn off this option.

